  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Zemingxingxiao — evidence-based brand diagnosis",
      "text": "English · [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nZemingxingxiao (择命行效) diagnoses business and brand problems across positioning, acquisition, product, conversion and retention. It combines cause and effect, five interconnected elements, and calibrated balance to locate breaks in a business chain and produce actionable HTML reports. Theory created by **Chang Liang (常亮)**; operated by **北京常识宋道商业咨询策划有限公司**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Zemingxingxiao — evidence-based brand diagnosis",
      "text": "**Skill release: 2.6.1 · 2026-10-30** · [Website](https://www.zmxx.work/) · [Public teaching cases](https://www.zmxx.work/cases) · [Downloads](https://www.zmxx.work/#download)\n\nInspect Metal → Water → Wood → Fire → Earth in order to avoid omissions. Repairs have **no fixed element order**: choose one or two initial actions based on losses, risk, evidence, dependencies, cost and reversibility. This is a business framework, not fortune-telling, stock prediction or a guarantee of growth."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start a diagnosis",
      "text": "Install `zemingxingxiao-brand-diagnosis/` in your host's supported skills location, or import the versioned ZIP if the platform accepts Agent Skills packages. The ZIP's internal folder remains stable across releases. `SKILL.md` uses standard frontmatter and string-valued metadata; file-based and DSH adapters remain available."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start a diagnosis",
      "text": "Ask “Diagnose my brand's retention problem” or “择命行效，帮我做品牌体检”. The assistant offers Chat and Full Report modes, collects business facts in short rounds, and produces evidence, uncertainties, repair priorities and measurable follow-up criteria. A project alias is sufficient; a real brand name is not required."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start a diagnosis",
      "text": "**Report language:** your explicit choice wins; otherwise the current conversation language applies; if unclear, the default is Simplified Chinese. An English discovery description does not force Chinese conversations into English. Both templates share the same theory and diagnosis rules. See [language and terminology](references/language.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Business research and follow-up",
      "text": "Retain substantive evidence: context, metric values and units, numerators and denominators, observation windows, sources, reasoning and counterevidence, proposed and actual actions, results, failures and disagreement. Aggregate revenue, costs, margin, orders and retention figures are not categorically excluded. Direct identifiers and identifying combinations are removed **before transmission**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Business research and follow-up",
      "text": "Submissions are for internal research. They are not automatically published, added to the public teaching library or exposed to other users. Existing valid authorization is reused without repeated prompts. When its scope is unclear, explain the recipient, deidentified records and internal research purpose once and obtain authorization; installation or a software license does not supply it. Installation and ordinary questions do not upload conversations, create research records or track installer identities."
    },
    {
      "section": "Business research and follow-up",
      "text": "When a formal diagnosis is complete, a host with Python and network capability must actually submit the authorized, deidentification-reviewed initial diagnosis using:\n\n```text\npython scripts/submit_case.py --input /private/path/case.json\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Business research and follow-up",
      "text": "The client prepares a deidentified local copy, sends it and records a real receipt. Report delivery must clearly state **received** with a real receipt ID, **pending** with a saved private outbox record and reason, or **not sent** with the reason. If a request was rejected, state that it was attempted but not accepted. A feedback invitation or disclaimer cannot replace submission. Network failures do not prevent report delivery. Per-case follow-up credentials stay in the private outbox, never in reports or public packages."
    },
    {
      "section": "Business research and follow-up",
      "text": "At skill start, `python scripts/submit_case.py --status` checks local state without networking. If networking is available, the assistant may retry at most one previously authorized and reviewed pending record using `--retry-pending --submission-id ID --retries 2 --timeout 15`; blocked or unauthorized drafts are excluded. This is a bounded recovery step, not a background service."
    },
    {
      "section": "Business research and follow-up",
      "text": "After delivery, the assistant actively invites an outcome update: action and date; cost and execution level; comparable before/after metrics and mature windows; concurrent changes; failure, harm or disagreement. Initial diagnosis records contain evidence, judgments and proposed actions; later `follow_up` records link actual actions and observed results to that diagnosis. Predictions are not actual outcomes. See the [complete workflow](references/research-feedback.md) and [schema](references/case-schema-v3.json). Synthetic examples demonstrate the structure; they are not customer success evidence."
    },
    {
      "section": "MIT License",
      "text": "Code, skill text, prompts, documentation and templates are released under the standard [MIT License](LICENSE). You may use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense and sell the Software, including commercially, provided the copyright and permission notices are retained in copies or substantial portions. Names, marks, third-party materials and non-public research data are outside the software license; see [RIGHTS.md](RIGHTS.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "The repository remains a DSH bundle with no runtime package dependencies:\n\n```text\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:changliang-c/zemingxingxiao-brand-diagnosis\n```\n\nRestart the host after installation. The adapter registers the main skill, five companion references and a routing prompt, with local paths to templates and assets. English and Chinese diagnosis requests are supported. Registration itself does not provide network access or prove successful transmission."
    },
    {
      "section": "Contents and verification",
      "text": "- `SKILL.md`: common rules and diagnostic workflow.\n- `references/`: original theory, procedures, terminology, bilingual templates, research schema and workflow.\n- `scripts/submit_case.py`: deidentification, private outbox, bounded retries and real receipts.\n- `examples/*.synthetic.json`: fictional diagnosis and linked follow-up.\n- `assets/`: framework illustrations.\n- `dsh/` and `cordis.patch.yml`: existing DSH integration."
    },
    {
      "section": "Contents and verification",
      "text": "Run `npm test` for DSH registration and cleanup; `python -m unittest discover -s test -p \"test_*.py\"` for transport and recovery; `python skill_test_suite.py` for existing static checks. Standard Agent Skills validation runs on the stable-name folder during release. Online store installation and network access depend on platform permissions and configuration."
    },
    {
      "section": "择命行效-行之有效的五行商业诊断理论体系",
      "text": "[English](README.md) · 简体中文"
    },
    {
      "section": "简介",
      "text": "品牌营销诊断与咨询报告生成器。基于**北京常识宋道商业咨询策划有限公司**出品的「**择命行效-行之有效的五行商业诊断理论体系**」（理论创立：常亮），用三大核心原则（因果·五行·度）和五行行动链（之金→行水→有木→效火→归土→循环）对品牌做全链条体检，定位断链环，输出含可视化图表的HTML诊断报告。\n\n问金环节含三刀定位法（心智阶梯扫描→空位探测→对立面校验）。提供三档入口：快速入象、完整五诊、案例对照。内置二百四十案行业案例库。\n\n**官方入口**：官网 https://www.zmxx.work ｜ 二百四十案案例库 https://www.zmxx.work/cases ｜ 工具下载 https://www.zmxx.work/#download\n\n**版本口径**：理论体系 v2.1 ｜ 诊断插件 v2.6.1（2026-10-30）｜ 适配稿引擎 v3.0"
    },
    {
      "section": "MIT 开源许可",
      "text": "本项目代码、技能文本、提示词、文档与模板依标准 [MIT License](LICENSE) 发布，可以使用、复制、修改、合并、发布、分发、再许可、销售及商用；在副本或实质性部分中保留版权与许可声明。名称与标识、第三方材料和非公开研究数据不随软件授权，详细边界见 [RIGHTS.md](RIGHTS.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "双语与效果反馈",
      "text": "用户指定报告语言优先，其次当前对话，无法判断则简体中文。英文 README 不会把国内中文对话强制改为英文。中英文报告共用理论规则和章节骨架，见 [语言规范](references/language.md)。\n\n研究回传先在本地去掉身份线索，保留经营数值、口径、分母、周期和判断依据。正式诊断完成时，宿主有发送能力就必须实际提交已获内部研究用途授权、通过去身份审查的初诊记录，并明确显示「已接收（回执号）／待补交（原因与本地包）／未发送（原因）」。邀请后续反馈或免责声明不能代替提交。已有有效授权不反复询问，首次范围不明时简明说明一次并补足授权，不以安装或软件许可代替授权。\n\n技能开始可执行 `python scripts/submit_case.py --status`，仅检查本地状态；有网络能力时最多重试一份此前已授权且已审查的待补交记录，次数有界。安装与普通问答不上传聊天、不新建研究记录、不追踪安装者身份。研究数据仅供内部分析，不自动进入公开案例库；网络失败保留本地补交包，不影响报告交付。"
    },
    {
      "section": "双语与效果反馈",
      "text": "初诊提交与经营效果跟进分开：前者记录当前证据、判断和建议，后者关联实际行动、成熟窗口后的结果与异议，不能把预测写成成效。报告完成后主动邀请用户按反馈日期补充真实结果。详见 [回传与反馈使用说明](references/research-feedback.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "适用场景",
      "text": "- 品牌诊断 / 品牌体检\n- 断链分析\n- 增长停滞诊断\n- 竞品对标诊断\n- 定位诊断 / 心智定位"
    },
    {
      "section": "不适用场景",
      "text": "- 写 slogan 或广告文案\n- 纯数据分析\n- 代码编写\n- 中医 / 算命的五行\n- 与品牌经营无关的话题"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速上手",
      "text": "1. 在 WorkBuddy 对话中输入触发词（如\"择命行效\"或\"品牌诊断\"）\n2. AI 先报 token 消耗区间，确认后进入信息收集\n3. 第一轮只问必填 3 项（品牌名或项目代称+品类/生命周期/痛点）\n4. 必填答完后补充选填 5 项（营收/渠道/复购/营销；公开竞品资料由 AI 在有联网能力时核实）\n5. 信息充足后 AI 输出 HTML 诊断报告（含水印+SVG 可视化+落款）"
    },
    {
      "section": "目录结构",
      "text": "```\nzemingxingxiao-brand-diagnosis/\n├── SKILL.md                # 核心 skill 文件（frontmatter + 指令）\n├── README.md               # 本文件\n├── LICENSE                 # 版权声明"
    },
